  "description": "Forge a legendary aesthetic with Western Metal, a powerhouse display typeface that captures a “rugged-and-rebellious” soul. This font features massive, high-contrast letterforms uniquely characterized by rhythmic, hand-drawn “spurs” and sharp, notched terminals that bridge the gap between frontier wood-type and modern heavy metal branding. With its heavy structural weight and lawless personality, Western Metal is the premier choice for independent brewery branding, vintage motorcycle apparel, rock music festival posters, and high-impact “grit-and-glory” social media headers.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Forge a legendary aesthetic with Western Metal, a powerhouse display typeface that captures a “rugged-and-rebellious” soul. This font features massive, high-contrast letterforms uniquely characterized by rhythmic, hand-drawn “spurs” and sharp, notched terminals that bridge the gap between frontier wood-type and modern heavy metal branding. With its heavy structural weight and lawless personality, Western Metal is the premier choice for independent brewery branding, vintage motorcycle apparel, rock music festival posters, and high-impact “grit-and-glory” social media headers.</p>",
